WEBVTT

00:00:00.627 --> 00:00:02.593
I <b>played</b> tennis yesterday.

00:00:05.653 --> 00:00:08.052
I <b>didn’t play</b> tennis yesterday.

00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:13.295
They <b>worked</b> all weekend.

00:00:16.378 --> 00:00:18.964
They <b>didn’t work</b> all weekend.

00:00:22.019 --> 00:00:23.318
<b>Did you like</b> the film?

00:00:26.346 --> 00:00:28.112
Yes, <b>I did</b>.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.346
No, <b>I didn’t</b>.

00:00:36.431 --> 00:00:38.227
Where <b>did they stay</b> in London?

00:00:41.286 --> 00:00:43.530
They <b>stayed</b> in a hotel in Chelsea.